---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Hire-Train-Deploy & staffing — Anvi Innovate" description="Anvi Innovate's engagement models for AI/ML work: hire-train-deploy, contract staffing, and contract-to-hire. Commercial structure, not black-box services.">
  <span class="pill">For Clients</span>
  <h1>Engagement models</h1>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width:760px;">Three ways to bring trained, screened AI/ML talent onto your team — all with skills we can show you before deployment.</p>

  <section class="card" style="margin-top:24px;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Hire-train-deploy (HTD)</h2>
    <p class="muted">We source freshers and career-switchers, put them through a structured GenAI curriculum, screen them for readiness, and deploy them into your team. Best for building AI/ML capacity at volume.</p>
    <ul class="muted" style="padding-left:18px;">
      <li>Ideal for annotation, RLHF, RAG and fine-tuning programs that need trained hands quickly.</li>
      <li>You define the skills and volume; we handle sourcing, training and vetting.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Contract staffing</h2>
    <p class="muted">Assessed resources embedded in your team on a contract basis, billed as a fixed monthly cost per resource. Scale up or down as your programme changes.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Contract-to-hire (C2H)</h2>
    <p class="muted">Start on contract, convert to your payroll when it's working. Conversion terms and a replacement window are set out in your engagement agreement.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin-top:18px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What we publish up front</h3>
    <p class="muted">The commercial <em>structure</em> — pricing model (fixed monthly vs. markup), conversion terms, replacement window, and invoicing cycle — is shared before you commit. Rates are quoted per engagement based on skills and volume.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/clients">Submit a hiring request</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:hello@anviinnovate.com" style="margin-left:10px;">Email hello@anviinnovate.com</a>
  </section>
</Base>
